1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Oline Olsd Bjelland was born in 1829, in Bjelland, Rogaland, Norge, her father, Ola Davidson, was 28 and her mother, Mallene Serine Sorensdatter Gjesdal, was 20. She married Lars Olsen Opsal on 30. juni 1850, in T
